&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre équipe Decathlon App recherche un·e Staff Product Manager (f/m/d) en CDI basé·e à Lille ou Paris.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au cœur de l&#39;écosystème digital de Decathlon, l&#39;équipe &lt;strong&gt;Decathlon App&lt;/strong&gt; fait le pont entre nos expériences e-commerce et le commerce physique. Notre mission dépasse la simple transaction : nous construisons un compagnon sportif quotidien, personnalisé et enrichi pour accompagner des millions d&#39;utilisateur·ices dans leur pratique. Rejoindre notre équipe produit globale (iOS &amp;amp; Android), c&#39;est évoluer dans un environnement stimulant où l&#39;autonomie, l&#39;impact à grande échelle et l&#39;excellence méthodologique sont au cœur de nos défis quotidiens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Staff Product Manager (f/m/d), tu apporteras la vision stratégique et l&#39;architecture fonctionnelle nécessaires pour faire passer notre application mobile à l&#39;échelle supérieure. Tu opéreras avec une grande autonomie sur des enjeux complexes pour transformer l&#39;expérience Decathlon App et garantir la cohérence de l&#39;écosystème.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tes responsabilités s&#39;articulent autour de 4 piliers stratégiques :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alignement stratégique, gestion des parties prenantes &amp;amp; vision app&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter la valeur globale (&lt;em&gt;macro view&lt;/em&gt;) générée par les initiatives mobiles clés sur l&#39;ensemble de l&#39;écosystème business et client, au-delà des backlogs d&#39;équipes individuelles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Porter la vision produit auprès de la direction exécutive, des leaders business et des parties prenantes transversales pour aligner l&#39;organisation sur la roadmap de l&#39;application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir les orientations stratégiques sur les segments utilisateurs prioritaires sur les points de contact mobiles natifs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre et optimiser les métriques de performance macro tout au long du funnel : notoriété, trafic, conversion, rétention et taux de réachat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture fonctionnelle &amp;amp; orchestration End-to-End&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agir en tant qu&#39;Architecte Fonctionnel·le principal·e en définissant la répartition des périmètres entre les squads afin d&#39;éliminer les frictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travailler en triade étroite avec les Staff Tech/Principal Engineers et les Staff UX Designers pour aligner l&#39;architecture technique, les systèmes de design et la vision produit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir des parcours omnicanaux sans couture reliant la découverte mobile, les interactions en magasin (ex: Scan &amp;amp; Go, retrait), le paiement et les services sportifs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sparring stratégique &amp;amp; de-risking produit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conseiller et accompagner les Group Product Managers (GPM) et Product Managers (PM) face aux dépendances complexes de l&#39;application et aux pièges classiques du produit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structurer des stratégies de réduction des risques (&lt;em&gt;de-risking&lt;/em&gt;) sur les projets majeurs pour identifier au plus tôt les enjeux d&#39;appétence, de viabilité et d&#39;utilisabilité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mener des boucles de validation concrètes (A/B testing, multivariés, tests d&#39;utilisabilité de prototypes) pour valider les hypothèses avant le déploiement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Élévation de la culture &amp;amp; des pratiques produit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner la communauté PM vers les meilleures pratiques produit modernes (frameworks de discovery, expérimentation continue, Opportunity Solution Trees - OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promouvoir l&#39;adoption des possibilités liées à l&#39;IA et des méthodologies avancées pour enrichir l&#39;expérience utilisateur et l&#39;efficacité des squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jouer un rôle de multiplicateur d&#39;impact pour faire grandir la communauté Produit, sans agir en tant que manager hiérarchique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience Mobile Native&lt;/strong&gt; : Solide parcours (7 ans+) en gestion de produits avec une expérience terrain dans la mise à l&#39;échelle d&#39;applications mobiles natives (iOS &amp;amp; Android) dans des environnements digitaux à fort volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complexité E-commerce &amp;amp; Retail&lt;/strong&gt; : Solide expérience dans l&#39;e-commerce, les plateformes digitales ou le retail omnicanal où les produits digitaux se connectent directement aux points de contact opérationnels physiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact transversal&lt;/strong&gt; : Expérience démontrée dans l&#39;alignement inter-équipes et les initiatives architecturales au sein d&#39;organisations produit multi-équipes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stratégie d&#39;Application Native&lt;/strong&gt; : Compréhension approfondie des paradigmes de design iOS/Android, des mécaniques des app stores, de l&#39;analytics mobile et des stratégies d&#39;engagement via push.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt; : Expertise des méthodes de discovery quantitatives et qualitatives, de l&#39;A/B testing, de l&#39;optimisation de conversion (CRO) et des Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture fonctionnelle&lt;/strong&gt; : Capacité à structurer des problèmes business complexes en stratégies de MVP/V0/V1 claires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication exécutive&lt;/strong&gt; : Aisance pour traduire des architectures produit, des métriques UX et des données en présentations claires et convaincantes pour les dirigeants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IA &amp;amp; Outils modernes&lt;/strong&gt; : Curiosité et expérience pratique de l&#39;intégration de l&#39;IA dans les workflows produit et les expériences utilisateurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posture &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence stratégique et intelligence émotionnelle (leadership sans autorité hiérarchique).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à s&#39;épanouir dans l&#39;ambiguïté et à structurer des défis complexes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Esprit de collaboration fort en Triade (Tech, Design, UXR, Data, Business).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathie et volonté de transmettre aux PM plus juniors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (actionnariat salarié, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L&#39;INCLUSION ET DE L&#39;ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es. Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🇬🇧 ENGLISH VERSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Decathlon App team is looking for a Staff Product Manager (f/m/d) on a Permanent Contract (CDI) based in Lille or Paris.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the core of Decathlon&#39;s digital ecosystem, the &lt;strong&gt;Decathlon App&lt;/strong&gt; team acts as the ultimate bridge between our digital commerce and physical store experiences. Our mission goes beyond transactions: we are building an indispensable daily sports companion for millions of users. Joining our global mobile team (iOS &amp;amp; Android) means evolving in a high-impact environment where autonomy, scaling challenges, and product excellence drive everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Product Manager (f/m/d), you will provide the strategic direction and functional architecture needed to scale our mobile platform across multiple product teams. Operating with high autonomy, you will address complex challenges to shape our long-term app experience and guarantee ecosystem cohesion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission centers on 4 strategic pillars:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Alignment, Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; App Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the holistic value (&lt;em&gt;macro view&lt;/em&gt;) generated by key mobile initiatives across the business and customer ecosystem, moving beyond individual squad backlogs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact narratives and presentations to executive leadership, business directors, and cross-functional stakeholders to align the organization on major platform shifts and app roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set strategic direction for key user segments across native mobile touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and optimize macro success metrics across the entire journey: Awareness, Traffic, Conversion, Retention, and Repeat Purchase Rate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Architecture &amp;amp; End-to-End Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the lead Functional Architect, defining how functional scope and boundaries are distributed across app feature squads to eliminate overlap and friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in tight Triad Collaboration with Staff/Principal Engineers and Staff UX Designers to align technical architecture, mobile design systems, and product vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design seamless, connected user journeys linking mobile discovery, in-store interactions (e.g., Scan &amp;amp; Go, store pickup), checkout, and sports services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sparring &amp;amp; Product De-Risking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted strategic advisor and sparring partner for Group Product Managers (GPMs) and PMs to help them navigate complex app dependencies and product traps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulate and drive product de-risking strategies for high-stakes app initiatives, identifying desirability, viability, and usability risks early in discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run concrete validation loops (A/B tests, multivariate testing, prototype usability tests) to validate hypotheses before engineering deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevating Product Craft &amp;amp; Mastery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upskill the PM community on modern product practices, standardizing discovery frameworks, continuous experimentation, and Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive organizational adoption of AI-first possibilities and advanced product methodologies to amplify app experience and squad efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a force multiplier: elevate the collective bar of the product management community without operating as a formal people manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE TABLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile Native Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven track record (7+ years) in Product Management with deep hands-on experience scaling native mobile applications (iOS &amp;amp; Android) in high-scale digital environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce &amp;amp; Retail Complexity&lt;/strong&gt;: Solid background in e-commerce, digital platforms, or omnichannel retail where digital products connect directly with physical operational touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transverse Scale&lt;/strong&gt;: Demonstrated experience driving cross-squad alignment and architectural initiatives across multi-team product organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native App Product Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep understanding of iOS/Android design paradigms, app store mechanics, mobile analytics, and push engagement strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Discovery &amp;amp; De-Risking&lt;/strong&gt;: Expertise in quantitative and qualitative discovery methods, CRO, A/B testing frameworks, and Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Architecture &amp;amp; Scoping&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to structure complex business problems into clear MVP/V0/V1 scoping playbooks and boundary maps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication &amp;amp; Storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to translate complex product architectures, UX metrics, and data insights into clear, persuasive executive presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Modern Product Stack&lt;/strong&gt;: Curiosity and practical experience integrating AI capabilities into product workflows and user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills &amp;amp; Behaviors:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Influence &amp;amp; Emotional Intelligence (influencing without hierarchical authority).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thriving in Ambiguity (highly autonomous self-starter).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triad &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration (Staff Tech, Staff Design, UXR, Data, Business).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth Mindset &amp;amp; Empathy (humble approach and dedicating time to mentor).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work organization;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equipment provided tailored to your role and our sustainability commitments (Mac or Windows);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local project team within a global network (international career opportunities);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous skills development and support (diverse projects, internal and external training, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive compensation package (employee stock ownership, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO INCLUSION AND ACCESSIBILITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams, and we continuously strive to foster and cultivate an inclusive and equitable workplace: this is why Inclusion is one of our Human Fundamentals. We encourage people of all backgrounds and abilities to apply, as we are convinced that diversity of thought, culture, identity, and lived experience makes us stronger. Decathlon is also committed to offering an inclusive and accessible recruitment process for all candidates. If you require any reasonable accommodations during the process, you can request them via the application form, and your request will remain confidential. These requests will not affect the outcome of your hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;The Senior Product Manager, Clinical Finance is a clinical-finance subject matter expert and product leader who creates meaningful value for sponsors, CROs, and sites. Working closely with the Associate Vice President, Product Management, this role helps set product strategy and roadmap direction across Suvoda’s&amp;nbsp;Greenphire&amp;nbsp;Clinical Finance suite, with primary focus on Budgeting &amp;amp; Benchmarking and Site Payments.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role brings together clinical pricing, investigator grant budgeting,&amp;nbsp;fair market value&amp;nbsp;benchmarking, sponsor/site negotiation, and payment execution. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The successful candidate will use direct sponsor-side experience to identify customer needs, shape product priorities, and provide initiative-level direction that helps Product Owners and delivery teams design effective software. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate brings deep sponsor-side clinical-finance expertise, hands-on experience implementing technology, and strong software product management experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep industry knowledge is the higher-priority qualification; candidates with less formal product-management experience may be successful with mentorship if they demonstrate sound product judgment, stakeholder leadership, and the ability to translate operational needs into technology solutions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Senior Product Manager manages and develops Product Owners and partners closely with them throughout discovery and delivery, ensuring they have the customer context, desired outcomes, priorities, and decision support needed to shape effective initiatives and epics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Partner with the Associate Vice President, Product Management, to set and communicate product vision, strategy, roadmap, and priorities for assigned&amp;nbsp;Greenphire&amp;nbsp;Clinical Finance products and capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Apply practical knowledge of sponsor-side clinical pricing, budgeting, benchmarking, site contracting, and payment operations to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;high-value opportunities and shape an integrated experience from study planning through payment execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Engage sponsors, CROs, sites, commercial teams, and internal subject matter experts to understand workflow challenges,&amp;nbsp;validatecustomer needs, and define meaningful product outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Lead initiative-level discovery by translating customer, business, operational, and market needs into problem statements, desired outcomes, scope boundaries, success measures, dependencies, and prioritized roadmap decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Manage, coach, and develop Product Owners through clear expectations, goal setting, workload planning, performance feedback, career development, and consistent product practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Partner closely with Product Owners as they shape initiatives and epics, providing customer and market context, roadmap rationale, decision support,&amp;nbsp;timelyanswers, ambiguity resolution, and facilitation of sound trade-off decisions with internal and external stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Recommend product investments to executive leadership using customer evidence, market analysis, business cases, and return-on-investment considerations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Collaborate with Product Owners, Engineering, UX, Architecture, Quality, Professional Services, Support, Commercial, Sales, and Marketing to deliver reliable, usable, and scalable software, prepare enhancements for successful launch, and drive effective sales enablement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Participate actively throughout the software development life cycle, from discovery and solution definition through delivery, validation, release, adoption, and continuous improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Establish success measures and use product data, customer feedback, and operational insight to evaluate outcomes and refine priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Support customer conversations, demonstrations, implementations, sales opportunities, competitive analysis, and thought leadership as needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Bachelor’s degree or equivalent combination of education, work experience, and/or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Direct experience with clinical trial sponsor budgeting, clinical pricing, investigator grant budgets, budget negotiation, benchmarking, site payment operations, or closely related clinical finance processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Demonstrated experience implementing, configuring, launching, or operationalizing technology within a pharmaceutical sponsor, biotechnology sponsor, CRO, clinical-trial, or related operational environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Experience working directly with sponsor study finance, clinical operations, outsourcing, procurement, site management, or comparable clinical-trial stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Formal product management experience, including managing software or SaaS products through discovery, strategy, roadmap development, prioritization, and delivery in partnership with Engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Experience owning or contributing to enterprise&amp;nbsp;clinical-trial&amp;nbsp;software throughout the software development life cycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Experience implementing or operationalizing Site Payments, a clinical payment platform, or related sponsor-side payment processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Experience with Budgeting &amp;amp; Benchmarking,&amp;nbsp;fair market value&amp;nbsp;data, site budget development, sponsor/site negotiations, or connected budget-to-payment workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Experience launching AI-based use cases, offerings, or product capabilities, including defining customer value, coordinating cross-functional readiness and enablement, supporting risk-aware rollout, and driving customer adoption.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Experience delivering products or solutions used across multiple countries, currencies, sponsors, CROs, sites, and payee models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core capabilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Deep understanding of sponsor and site workflows across clinical pricing, budgeting, benchmarking, contracting, and payment operations, with the ability to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;high-value opportunities and shape meaningful product outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Ability to partner with the Associate Vice President, Product Management, to shape product strategy and roadmap direction and frame initiatives through clear problems, desired outcomes, scope, success measures, dependencies, and priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Experienced people manager with a demonstrated ability to coach and develop team members through clear expectations, regular feedback, workload planning, and career development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Ability to provide Product Owners and cross-functional teams with customer context, roadmap rationale,&amp;nbsp;timely&amp;nbsp;answers, ambiguity resolution, and sound decision support as initiatives and epics are developed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Ability to influence cross-functional teams and make sound decisions in a complex, matrixed environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Demonstrated ability to collaborate with Professional Services and Marketing to launch software enhancements, align implementation and enablement, communicate value, and drive customer adoption&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Strong analytical, strategic, communication, and stakeholder-management skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Typically 8 or more years of relevant experience across clinical pricing, sponsor-side clinical finance, clinical trial budgeting, site payments, study operations, technology implementation, or product management; substantial sponsor-side industry experience may outweigh formal product-management tenure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Experience in clinical trial technology, financial operations software, regulated SaaS, or other data-driven and operationally complex environments is highly valued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Working relationships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:480,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role works closely with the Associate Vice President, Product Management; manages and develops Product Owners; and partners with Engineering; UX; Architecture; Quality; Services; Support; Commercial; Marketing; and external sponsors, CROs, and sites.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role requires the ability to communicate credibly with sponsors, CROs, sites, clinical-finance practitioners, Product Owners, and software delivery teams, connecting real-world operational needs to clear initiative direction, product decisions, and measurable outcomes.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are aware that an individual(s) are fraudulently representing themselves as Suvoda recruiters and/or hiring managers. Suvoda will never request personal information such as your bank account number, credit card number, drivers license or social security number — or request payment from you — during the job application or interview process. Any emails from the Suvoda recruiting team will come from a ----- email address. You can learn more about these types of fraud by referring to &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://consumer.ftc.gov/consumer-alerts/2023/05/scammers-are-hijacking-job-ads-heres-how-spot-fakes&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://consumer.ftc.gov/consumer-alerts/2023/05/scammers-are-hijacking-job-ads-heres-how-spot-fakes&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;this FTC consumer alert&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As set forth in Suvoda’s Equal Employment Opportunity policy, we do not discriminate on the basis of any protected group status under any applicable law.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you are based in California, we encourage you to read this important information for California residents linked &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.suvoda.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice-and-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#36b37e&quot;&gt;IDnow is a&lt;strong&gt; leader in digital identity and fraud prevention in Europe&lt;/strong&gt; with a mission to transform trust into the most powerful asset in the digital world, empowering enterprises with &lt;strong&gt;AI-driven, SaaS-based identity solutions that deliver scalable security, adaptive compliance, and real-time fraud prevention&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#36b37e&quot;&gt;Through its broad portfolio of digital identity and fraud prevention solutions, IDnow establishes, maintains and enriches trust throughout the customer journey, ensuring businesses can confidently and securely operate while leveraging digital identity to drive growth, security and scalability. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#36b37e&quot;&gt;The company has &lt;strong&gt;offices in Germany, United Kingdom, Romania and France&lt;/strong&gt;, and is backed by renowned institutional investors, including Corsair Capital and Seventure Partners. Its &lt;strong&gt;portfolio of international clients spans a wide range of end markets&lt;/strong&gt; including financial services, telecommunications, travel &amp;amp; mobility, gaming, and other industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This position is based in Rennes/Paris, France and a fixed term(full time) contract of 1 year as a maternity replacement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As&lt;strong&gt; (&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Senior) Product Manager, Trust Platform – Digital Identities(f/m/d)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, you own the product direction for how IDnow&#39;s Trust Platform supports European eID schemes and EUDI Wallets. You define the strategy for digital identity methods, act as the counterpart to IDnow&#39;s Trust Services team, and ensure the platform stays ahead of eIDAS 2.0 requirements as they become mandatory across the EU. This is a focused, partially technical role that requires depth over breadth: you go deep into the specifications of eID schemes and EUDI Wallets rather than staying at a surface level.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You shape how IDnow&#39;s Trust Platform supports digital identities across Europe, ensuring customers can rely on compliant, seamless, and secure identification methods.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strategic Portfolio: Define the digital identity strategy and portfolio of identification methods for EUDI Wallets and eIDs, evaluating and deciding between direct integrations and broker-based approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Trust Services Counterpart: Act as the counterpart to IDnow&#39;s Trust Services team and ensure a smooth integration of electronic signatures, Qualified Electronic Attestations of Attributes (QEAAs), and related trust services into the Trust Platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Regulatory Leadership: Stay ahead of eIDAS 2.0 and EUDI Wallet standards, tracking evolving technical specifications and implementing acts to ensure the platform is compliant well before deadlines hit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Identity Interoperability: Ensure seamless cross-border identity verification, managing the nuances of different EU member state requirements, national eID schemes, and trust frameworks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Conversion Optimization: Analyze the friction-versus-security trade-off for each identification method and provide clear recommendations to help customers maximize their onboarding rates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end specification of eID and EUDI Wallet integrations, going into technical detail on protocols, data models, and trust frameworks. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with Engineering, Legal, Compliance, and Solutions teams to translate regulatory requirements into concrete product and technical specifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; ----- alt=&quot;:no_entry:&quot; width=&quot;12&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Turn back if…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• You are not comfortable diving into regulatory requirements in depth and becoming a subject matter expert on EUDI wallets and national eID schemes.&lt;br&gt;• You&#39;re most comfortable in a traditional product-owner role centred on backlog management and delivery, rather than shaping strategy and technical specifications..&lt;br&gt;• You want a fully structured environment where every process and specification is already documented — this role is about defining the direction while the standards themselves are still evolving..&lt;br&gt;• You&#39;re not willing to travel frequently to Rennes or work across multiple jurisdictions and member-state requirements..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Bring 5 + product management experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; with end-to-end ownership of product strategy, discovery, prioritisation, delivery, and continuous improvement, ideally in a regulated or standards-driven environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Knowledge of eID schemes or EUDI Wallets is a strong plus – you are comfortable navigating technical specifications, protocols, and regulatory texts in depth, not just at a conceptual level.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Knowledge of Identity &amp;amp; Access Management and authentication protocols such as OIDC, SAML, and OAuth is a strong plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrate experience in digital identity, trust services, fraud prevention, compliance, or a regulated industry such as banking, fintech, insurance, or telecommunications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Show a high level of autonomy and ownership: this is a focused scope that requires a strong, detail-oriented executor who can work independently while always keeping track of business metrics and customer feedback.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Communicate complex regulatory and technical topics clearly to engineering teams, senior stakeholders, customers, and internal enablement audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Willingness to be based in or travel frequently to Rennes, France, to work closely with the local team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Fluency in English and French is required; additional European languages are a plus given the cross-border, multi-jurisdictional nature of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing: Use your full access to the mental health platform nilo, including 1on1 sessions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We value personal and professional development: make full use of Udemy, our training platform with 24/7 access and unlimited licences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We make your remote work comfy: we provide support on equipment and offer flexible working hours.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We value collaboration &amp;amp; love to come together: regular onsite gatherings, internal initiatives and summer parties to connect across teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;May your family require your attention or other reasons apply: use the benefits of our parental leave policy or our sabbatical programme.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In addition to the perks &amp;amp; benefits above, we offer specific benefits that differ between our locations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IDnow applies the principles of non-discrimination and equality: We strive to establish, maintain, and promote an open and inclusive recruitment process and working environment by respecting the principles of equal opportunities. Including but not limited to: race or ethnic origin, religion or convictions, gender identity or expression, citizenship, marital status, disability, age, or sexual orientation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre équipe Finance Data recherche un·e Product Manager basé·e à Lille ou Paris.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_6904b8d41c6c975f-334&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0&quot;&gt;Au sein de l&#39;équipe Finance Data &amp;amp; AI, nous transformons en profondeur le pilotage de la performance commerciale et financière. Notre objectif : faire évoluer le contrôle de gestion traditionnel (FP&amp;amp;A) d&#39;un reporting manuel à un pilotage stratégique automatisé et prescripteur, propulsé par l&#39;IA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_6904b8d41c6c975f-335&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0&quot;&gt;En tant que Product Manager Finance Data, vous intégrez une équipe pluridisciplinaire (Data Engineers, AI Engineers, Analytics Engineers et experts métiers)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2&quot;&gt;. Vous pilotez le développement et l&#39;expansion à l&#39;échelle internationale de notre portefeuille de solutions IA dédiées à la transformation des métiers du FP&amp;amp;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Data Project Manager, vous aurez l’occasion de :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mener l&#39;exploration continue et la product discovery en contact avec le métier&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mener des travaux de recherche sur de nouveaux produits d’advanced analytics, d’intelligence artificielle ou d’autres solutions novatrices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir les KPIs sur lesquels s’animer et estimer la création de valeur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Créer, maintenir, prioriser et communiquer sur le backlog produit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsabiliser l’équipe sur les livraisons: respect des principes structurants inhérents aux données de ton produit, prise en compte de la qualité&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre en place les processus de product management pour optimiser la gestion de la zone insight Finance, qui contient l&#39;ensemble des indicateurs du domaine (discovery, backlog management, TTM measurement,...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Élaborer la roadmap et la planification de futures créations d&#39;indicateurs et métriques en alignant les besoins du métier&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formaliser dans le wiki organisé de la vue technique et des data nécessaires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner les développeurs BI Eng, Analytics engineers et AI engineers dans la création des indicateurs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre en place des process de Run, de mesure du Run et d&#39;auditabilité pour garantir la disponibilité et la sécurité des indicateurs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer les accès des utilisateurs finaux et data à nos solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir l&#39;accès aux outils en fonction des usages de la data finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pratiquer les méthodes agiles et participer à l’ensemble des cérémonies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Environnement AWS (S3, Athena...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks: Genie, Apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technos/langages : Python, SQL, Spark / Scala, Airflow, DBT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez déjà plusieurs expériences réussies (3 ans minimum hors alternance) en tant que Product Manager sur des projets data ou digitaux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez un état d&#39;esprit agile tourné vers l&#39;amélioration continue et l&#39;intelligence collective. Vous êtes passionné-e de projet et aimez partager et contribuer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez de bonnes capacités de communication et de collaborations, spécialement dans un environnement international (niveau d’anglais B2 minimum)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Les projets challengeant vous motivent et vous souhaitez prendre des responsabilités rapidement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes passionné-e de sport et vous aimez vivre vos passions en équipe !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez envie de rejoindre une entreprise à impact positif&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 jours de télétravail par semaine ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possibilité de travailler dans l&#39;un des bureaux de Decathlon Digital à Lille ou Paris ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac, Windows, ou Chromebooks) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, certifications techniques dès la première année, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (participation des employés aux actions de l&#39;entreprise, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Joining Capco means joining an organisation that is committed to an inclusive working environment where you’re encouraged to #BeYourselfAtWork. We celebrate individuality and recognize that diversity and inclusion, in all forms, is critical to success. It’s important to us that we recruit and develop as diverse a range of talent as we can and we believe that everyone brings something different to the table – so we’d love to know what makes you different. Such differences may mean we need to make changes to our process to allow you the best possible platform to succeed, and we are happy to cater to any reasonable adjustments you may require. You will find the section to let us know of these at the bottom of your application form or you can mention it directly to your recruiter at any stage and they will be happy to help.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is a global technology and business consultancy, focused on the financial services sector. We are passionate about helping our clients succeed in an ever-changing industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experts in capital markets,&lt;span class=&quot;Highlight&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;banking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Highlight&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;and payments and wealth and asset management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge in financial services offering, including e.g.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;Highlight&quot;&gt;Finance&lt;/span&gt;, Risk and Compliance, Financial Crime, Core&lt;em class=&quot;Highlight&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Highlight&quot;&gt;Banking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Highlight&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Committed to growing our business and hiring the best talent to help us get there&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on maintaining our nimble,&lt;span class=&quot;Highlight&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;agile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Highlight&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;and entrepreneurial culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-section-id=&quot;1hl1yo8&quot; data-start=&quot;306&quot; data-end=&quot;321&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;309&quot; data-end=&quot;321&quot;&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;826&quot; data-end=&quot;1152&quot;&gt;As a Senior IT Project Manager, you will lead strategic technology transformation initiatives for one of Switzerland&#39;s leading retail banks. Working at the intersection of business and technology, you will deliver complex programmes spanning data, CRM, master data management, regulatory change, and enterprise transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1154&quot; data-end=&quot;1690&quot;&gt;You will collaborate with senior business stakeholders, architects, engineering teams and delivery partners to successfully execute large-scale initiatives that improve operational efficiency, strengthen data capabilities, and support the bank&#39;s digital strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1xihhvk&quot; data-start=&quot;1692&quot; data-end=&quot;1713&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1713&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1715&quot; data-end=&quot;2623&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fht1vc&quot; data-start=&quot;1715&quot; data-end=&quot;1872&quot;&gt;Lead complex transformation programmes across data, CRM, master data, regulatory and enterprise technology initiatives within a retail banking environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;165b2cv&quot; data-start=&quot;1873&quot; data-end=&quot;2060&quot;&gt;Manage cross-functional teams, business stakeholders, architects and technology partners to successfully deliver strategic programmes while balancing scope, timelines, quality and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ctf5bz&quot; data-start=&quot;2061&quot; data-end=&quot;2237&quot;&gt;Drive the definition and implementation of enterprise-wide data and master data strategies that support business transformation, regulatory compliance and digital innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vpxzlb&quot; data-start=&quot;2238&quot; data-end=&quot;2481&quot;&gt;Facilitate collaboration between Business, IT, Data, Architecture and Operations while leveraging &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2338&quot; data-end=&quot;2392&quot;&gt;AI-enabled workflows and approved automation tools&lt;/strong&gt; to improve project delivery, reporting and decision-making under appropriate governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13ogaxr&quot; data-start=&quot;2482&quot; data-end=&quot;2623&quot;&gt;Apply Agile delivery methodologies using Jira, Confluence and modern project management practices to deliver sustainable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-section-id=&quot;u9wmb5&quot; data-start=&quot;2625&quot; data-end=&quot;2654&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2628&quot; data-end=&quot;2654&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2656&quot; data-end=&quot;3598&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ahjalk&quot; data-start=&quot;2656&quot; data-end=&quot;2840&quot;&gt;8–10+ years&#39; experience as a Senior IT Project Manager, Programme Manager, Transformation Manager, Stream Lead or Data Strategy &amp;amp; Advisory Lead, preferably within Financial Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1oqlz8r&quot; data-start=&quot;2841&quot; data-end=&quot;3059&quot;&gt;Proven experience delivering complex transformation, optimisation, CRM, master data, data management or enterprise technology programmes within banking, financial services, insurance or large enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t759rj&quot; data-start=&quot;3060&quot; data-end=&quot;3247&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise application landscapes, solution architecture, data governance, master data management, analytics, process optimisation and technology transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1brpnzs&quot; data-start=&quot;3248&quot; data-end=&quot;3535&quot;&gt;Excellent stakeholder management, communication and analytical skills with the ability to bridge Business, IT, Data and Architecture teams. &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3390&quot; data-end=&quot;3535&quot;&gt;Comfortable adopting approved AI tools responsibly to improve productivity while applying sound judgement, governance and appropriate review.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sbpfwn&quot; data-start=&quot;3536&quot; data-end=&quot;3598&quot;&gt;Fluent German (C2 or near-native) and English (B2 or above).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;prnxb8&quot; data-start=&quot;3600&quot; data-end=&quot;3623&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3603&quot; data-end=&quot;3623&quot;&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3625&quot; data-end=&quot;4097&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5mg7in&quot; data-start=&quot;3625&quot; data-end=&quot;3773&quot;&gt;Experience with Data Governance, Data Quality, CRM, CLM, Data Literacy, Advanced Analytics, cloud-based data platforms or AI adoption initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mb3ibm&quot; data-start=&quot;3774&quot; data-end=&quot;3864&quot;&gt;Experience delivering large-scale transformation programmes within Swiss retail banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;zv33mf&quot; data-start=&quot;3865&quot; data-end=&quot;3956&quot;&gt;Relevant certifications such as PMP, PRINCE2, SAFe, Scrum, Agile or Cloud certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the Next Step&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like you, we would love to hear from you. &amp;nbsp;This is an opportunity to make a difference and contribute to a highly successful company with a significant growth trajectory.&lt;/p&gt;
